Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.90,0:00:19.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now you just have to find it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.96,0:00:24.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,These words lured men to\Nthe Grand Line in pursuit
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.34,0:00:26.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,of dreams greater than\Nthey'd ever dared to imagine.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.78,0:00:29.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is the time known\Nas the Great Pirate Era.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.62,0:00:35.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come aboard and bring along\Nall your hopes and dreams.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.72,0:00:40.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Together we will find everything\Nthat we're looking for!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.54,0:00:42.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One piece.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.02,0:00:52.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Compass left behind,\Nit'll only slow us down.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.70,0:00:58.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your heart will be your guide,\Nraise the sails and take the helm.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.52,0:01:01.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That legendary place!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.20,0:01:03.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That the end of the map reveals?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.90,0:01:06.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is only legendary.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.80,0:01:10.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Till someone proves it real.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.22,0:01:12.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Through it all!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.66,0:01:14.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Through all the trouble of times!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.54,0:01:15.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Through the heartache!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.82,0:01:16.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And through the pain!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.92,0:01:19.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Know that I will be there!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.66,0:01:21.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To stand by you!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.48,0:01:24.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Like I know you'll stand by me!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.36,0:01:26.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So come aboard!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.90,0:01:30.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And bring along all your hopes and dreams.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.44,0:01:36.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Together we will find everything\Nthat we're looking for!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.26,0:01:39.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's always room for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.82,0:01:42.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you want to be my friend!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.14,0:01:46.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We are, we are on the crew!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.48,0:01:49.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We are!
Dialogue: 1,0:01:50.05,0:01:53.13,Title-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.5\fad(978,0)\3c&H1E1E1E&\c&H1E1E1E&\bord2.3\1a&HFF&\t(936,978,\1a&H00&)}Bell-mère
Dialogue: 2,0:01:50.05,0:01:53.13,Title-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.5\fad(978,0)\c&HE7E6E6&\bord0\4a&HFF&}Bell-mère
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.04,0:01:55.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, so tell us all about it?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.36,0:01:57.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I gotta admit, I'm curious.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.40,0:01:59.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll pass. Hey, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.40,0:02:01.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't care about our past.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.26,0:02:03.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where are you going, Luffy? For a walk.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.18,0:02:05.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A walk?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.09,0:02:07.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you mean you're not\Ngonna listen to this?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.28,0:02:08.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nope.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.08,0:02:10.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who's he?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.02,0:02:13.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't mind him.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.20,0:02:14.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's just how he is.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.92,0:02:17.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll hear you out.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.18,0:02:20.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Though I can tell you right now, I\Ndon't think it's gonna change anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.32,0:02:21.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, I'll listen, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.94,0:02:26.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It might help me make some sense out of\Neverything that's going on around here.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.16,0:02:26.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Me too.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.10,0:02:28.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want to know all about her.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.84,0:02:32.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now he's asleep. Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.82,0:02:34.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You said you'd hear her out!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.98,0:02:39.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm, I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.46,0:02:41.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is why it was hard for her.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.70,0:02:48.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I fell asleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.12,0:02:52.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh no, Nojiko.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.94,0:02:55.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wonder where she ran off to.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.20,0:03:05.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just a little more, Bellamy.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.82,0:03:09.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just a little more and\Neverything will be ours again.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.72,0:03:13.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cocoyashi village, the\Ntangerine farm, everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.64,0:03:23.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's taken eight years.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:33.36,0:03:37.32,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.7\fad(479,0)\an8\bord4.5\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\fscx85\fscy90\pos(720,168)\c&H000000&\3c&H000000&\1a&HFF&\t(437,479,\1a&H00&)}Nami (8 Years Ago)
Dialogue: 2,0:03:33.36,0:03:37.32,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.7\fad(479,0)\an8\bord0\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\fscx85\fscy90\pos(720,168)\c&HFAF9FA&\4a&HFF&}Nami (8 Years Ago)
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.24,0:03:35.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's done!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.68,0:03:36.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's done!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.60,0:03:38.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.96,0:03:47.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now if I could just get that book.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.98,0:03:59.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, is that you, Nami?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.66,0:04:01.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you need any help there?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.50,0:04:03.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, I'm just looking.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.28,0:04:05.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll be going now.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.94,0:04:17.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's too bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.58,0:04:18.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn it, Nami!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.96,0:04:23.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not again, Sticky Fingers.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.10,0:04:28.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You little urchin.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:27.50,0:04:32.46,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.7\fad(476,480)\an8\bord4\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\fscx85\fscy90\pos(720,635)\c&H000000&\3c&H000000&\1a&HFF&\t(434,476,\1a&H00&)\t(4480,4522,\1a&HFF&)}Genzo (8 Years Ago)
Dialogue: 2,0:04:27.50,0:04:32.46,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.7\fad(476,480)\an8\bord0\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\fscx85\fscy90\pos(720,635)\c&HFAFAFB&\4a&HFF&}Genzo (8 Years Ago)
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.06,0:04:32.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How many times do I have to\Ntell you that stealing is wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.10,0:04:34.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How else am I gonna get what I need?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.70,0:04:36.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't have any money.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.32,0:04:38.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Chipscake!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.76,0:04:41.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bellamy! Bellamy!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.32,0:04:43.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I caught her stealing again!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.16,0:04:45.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now open up this door!
Dialogue: 1,0:04:47.39,0:04:50.90,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.7\fad(481,0)\an8\bord4.5\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp Pace\fscx85\fscy90\pos(720,80)\c&H000000&\3c&H000000&\1a&HFF&\t(439,481,\1a&H00&)}Bell-mère\NNami and Nojiko's\NFoster Mother
Dialogue: 2,0:04:47.39,0:04:50.90,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.7\fad(481,0)\an8\bord0\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp Pace\fscx85\fscy90\pos(720,80)\c&HFAF9FA&\4a&HFF&}Bell-mère\NNami and Nojiko's\NFoster Mother
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.64,0:04:50.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you want now?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.38,0:04:52.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're back.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.60,0:04:53.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was a quick trip.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.94,0:04:54.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I got a ride.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.38,0:04:59.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Listen, you better get control of her\Nbefore she winds up in a jail cell.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.78,0:05:02.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks for the advice.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.92,0:05:06.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Haven't you ever seen something\Nyou've wanted and just taken it?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.36,0:05:08.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're the reason she acts this way!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.50,0:05:10.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Relax, I'm just kidding.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.50,0:05:13.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hope you were kind\Nenough to pay for her.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.52,0:05:14.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, Bellamy?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.30,0:05:16.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.54,0:05:18.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't have the money right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.38,0:05:19.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll pay it somehow.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.82,0:05:22.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Does that sound good?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.10,0:05:26.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't say things like that!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.78,0:05:30.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look, he's as red as a beet!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.96,0:05:38.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now then, laugh it up\Nwhile you still can, Nami.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.82,0:05:41.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.74,0:05:46.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's just that I really\Nneed that book, Bellamy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.46,0:05:49.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then why didn't you ask me\Nif I would buy it for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.84,0:05:52.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because I know you can't afford it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.14,0:05:54.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course I can.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.46,0:05:56.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's money left over\Nfrom the last harvest.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.76,0:05:58.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I heard them in the village.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.44,0:06:00.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They said the weather's\Nbeen so good lately?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.00,0:06:04.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That everyone's tangerines will sell,\NWhich means we can't raise our price!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.84,0:06:06.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,or we may not be able to sell at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.80,0:06:08.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They don't know what\Nthey're talking about.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:08.89,0:06:11.27,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.7\fad(479,0)\an8\bord4\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\fscx85\fscy90\pos(720,635)\c&H000000&\3c&H000000&\1a&HFF&\t(437,479,\1a&H00&)}Nojiko (8 Years Ago)
Dialogue: 2,0:06:08.89,0:06:11.27,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.7\fad(479,0)\an8\bord0\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\fscx85\fscy90\pos(720,635)\c&HFAFAFB&\4a&HFF&}Nojiko (8 Years Ago)
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.04,0:06:10.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Way to go, Nami.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.80,0:06:14.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I had stolen it, there's no\Nway I would have been caught.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.54,0:06:17.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No more stealing, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.74,0:06:20.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was just joking, that's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.56,0:06:21.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That really hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.74,0:06:28.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, but one thing's for sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.78,0:06:31.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The maps you draw are so amazing, Nami!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.38,0:06:36.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I see you can draw land maps\Nnow as well as sea charts.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.98,0:06:40.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's the map of our island, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.82,0:06:45.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nobody will believe that such a\Nlittle girl drew this all by herself.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.96,0:06:50.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wanted the book so I'd be able\Nto start studying navigation.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.34,0:06:52.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Navigation as well?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.74,0:06:55.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're going to be a\Nnavigator? That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.66,0:06:58.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm going to guide ships around\Nall the oceans of the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.90,0:06:59.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It'll be great.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.74,0:07:04.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I'll be able to make maps of\Nall the far-off places I'll go.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.86,0:07:09.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, this island map is a first\Nstep toward realizing your dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.46,0:07:10.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that it?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.08,0:07:11.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.04,0:07:14.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A world map, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.58,0:07:17.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nami, your dream is going to come true.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.72,0:07:19.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have no doubt.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.06,0:07:31.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Bellamy. Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.60,0:07:34.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why haven't you been eating\Ndinner with us lately?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.22,0:07:35.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've been eating tangerines.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.08,0:07:38.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've just been on a diet, that's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.50,0:07:40.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then I don't want to eat either.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.48,0:07:42.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's with all of the drama?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.18,0:07:44.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You need to eat because\Nyou are a growing girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.68,0:07:46.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why do you keep lying to us?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.30,0:07:49.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're not eating because we don't\Nhave enough money to buy food.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.22,0:07:50.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's why. Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.14,0:07:54.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're starving yourself\Nso that we won't go hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.76,0:07:58.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tangerines replenish my skin with\Nthe power of liquid sunlight.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.22,0:08:01.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And they are the only reason I\Nam still such a ravishing beauty,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.38,0:08:03.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,even though I am in my extreme late 20s.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.08,0:08:05.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But your hands are all yellow.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.84,0:08:08.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Would you just shut up\Nand eat your food already?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.42,0:08:10.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And here you go, Nami.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.16,0:08:12.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All done.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.10,0:08:14.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A Bellamy one-of-a-kind\Noriginal. Oh, great.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.98,0:08:15.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A hand-me-down.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.92,0:08:17.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.10,0:08:18.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But it suits you. See, look.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.46,0:08:21.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But the lion used to be a sunflower.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.18,0:08:23.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Quit complaining.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.16,0:08:26.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You have to take my hand-me-downs\Nor you won't get any new clothes.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.66,0:08:27.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But it's not fair.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.74,0:08:30.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You get new clothes all the\Ntime and mine are all used.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.82,0:08:32.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I get old clothes too, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.84,0:08:35.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So just suck it up, Nami,\Nand take what you get.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.62,0:08:36.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.56,0:08:39.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We didn't come from the\Nsame parents anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.26,0:08:41.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're not real sisters, so who cares?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.40,0:08:43.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nami!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.72,0:08:52.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bellamy, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.80,0:09:01.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So what if you don't\Nhave the same parents?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.32,0:09:07.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't ever want to hear you\Nsay anything like that again!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.46,0:09:09.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't care.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.46,0:09:12.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're not even our real mother!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.30,0:09:14.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're just some lady\Nwho's taking care of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.70,0:09:19.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You wish we'd never come here so you\Ncould buy clothes and food for yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.38,0:09:21.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'd be better off\Nwithout us, wouldn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.82,0:09:25.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That way you could be selfish\Nand do whatever you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.36,0:09:26.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wish...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.06,0:09:31.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wish that one rich would have adopted\Nus instead of a sneaky loser like you!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.64,0:09:40.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.78,0:09:46.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you hate it here so much, you can go\Nfind someplace else to live if you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.30,0:09:47.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I didn't sign up for this.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.12,0:09:49.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop fighting!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.20,0:09:50.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please, just stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.86,0:09:52.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm never coming back!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.42,0:09:55.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop! Stop! Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.80,0:10:08.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bellamy, the three of us are a family.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.22,0:10:09.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's the truth!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.90,0:10:13.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And you know Nami feels the\Nsame, no matter what she said.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.82,0:10:17.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look who's being the adult here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.96,0:10:20.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I blew up, and you're\Nthe level-headed one.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.34,0:10:23.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why don't you go and find Nami?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.46,0:10:27.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll make something special for\Ndinner, and we can all make up, okay?
Dialogue: 1,0:10:36.62,0:10:41.54,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.7\fad(475,0)\an8\bord4\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\fscx85\fscy90\pos(720,635)\c&H000000&\3c&H000000&\1a&HFF&\t(433,475,\1a&H00&)}Cocoyashi Village
Dialogue: 2,0:10:36.62,0:10:41.54,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.7\fad(475,0)\an8\bord0\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\fscx85\fscy90\pos(720,635)\c&HFAFAFB&\4a&HFF&}Cocoyashi Village
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.82,0:10:42.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry, lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.74,0:10:44.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Two for five is the\Nlowest price I can offer.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.80,0:10:46.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Isn't that really your best offer?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.62,0:10:48.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Half off.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.74,0:10:49.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Today only.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.92,0:10:50.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fresh produce.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.84,0:10:53.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You won't find a lower\Nprice anywhere today.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.42,0:10:55.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guarantee it or you're money back.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.86,0:11:06.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So you've run away from home\Nand come to the village.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.84,0:11:08.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now what's the plan?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.48,0:11:12.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Drink before it gets cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.32,0:11:19.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bellamy would be so much happier if\Nshe didn't have to take care of us?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.62,0:11:21.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And why would you say that?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.96,0:11:24.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, you need a lot of money\Nto take care of two kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.62,0:11:28.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And because of me, the whole\Nvillage hates her right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.52,0:11:29.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's progress.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.36,0:11:32.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At least you're considering others.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.52,0:11:34.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.54,0:11:37.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When Bellamy was your age,\Nhe was a complete nightmare.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.50,0:11:39.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,terrorizing the entire village.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.48,0:11:41.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that the truth? Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.62,0:11:45.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even now the villagers look at\Nher as some kind of a Scrap.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.48,0:11:49.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So you can imagine how surprised everyone\Nin the village was when she joined up?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.56,0:11:50.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,with the marines, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.16,0:11:51.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Marines?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.07,0:11:55.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You mean Bellamy was in\Nthe marines? That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.94,0:12:08.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She said she couldn't stand by and do\Nnothing while pirates killed innocent people.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.26,0:12:10.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then she left the village.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.42,0:12:22.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She was teetering on the\Nverge of death when...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.58,0:12:27.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If this is the end, then so be it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.06,0:12:46.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your little sister?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.46,0:12:52.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh-uh.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.16,0:12:54.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I found her.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.04,0:13:05.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How did she survive?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.08,0:13:23.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That innocent child was you, Nami.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.14,0:13:29.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And seeing how precious you were gave\NBellamy the right reasons to live again.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.36,0:13:42.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It is a ship! I knew it!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.66,0:13:45.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who on earth would be out\Nin such a terrible storm?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.54,0:13:56.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Doctor.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.45,0:13:57.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I need a doctor.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.72,0:13:58.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.96,0:14:00.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What happened to you, Bellamy?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.06,0:14:01.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bellamere!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.97,0:14:03.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did somebody call for a doctor?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.12,0:14:08.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who are these children? Doctor!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.48,0:14:09.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're burning up.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.40,0:14:11.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid they might be really sick.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.22,0:14:12.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please, help them.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.34,0:14:13.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Give them here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.34,0:14:19.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, and we'd better mend up those\Nnasty wounds of yours as well, young lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.64,0:14:20.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Never mind me!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.14,0:14:22.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please, just don't let them die.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.96,0:14:24.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You have to save me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.26,0:14:26.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Him, I'm begging.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.56,0:14:33.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you doctor I don't
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.34,0:14:35.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,believe it say that whole thing again
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.72,0:14:39.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I said I'm gonna try To be the mother\Nof these two girls it's that simple
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.96,0:14:44.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,no way that's insane you are far\Ntoo Immature to handle this much
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.88,0:14:50.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,responsibility you can't handle them by\Nyourself just hand them over to the...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.08,0:14:51.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've made my mind!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.10,0:14:54.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't deny that I'm an adult,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.08,0:14:56.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and what I've lived through\Nas a Marine has given
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.28,0:14:58.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,me the right to be\Ntreated with more respect.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.64,0:15:01.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm perfectly capable of\Ntaking care of these two girls.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.38,0:15:05.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And nothing can stop me from\Nraising them to be wonderful.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.36,0:15:06.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,girls.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.94,0:15:10.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So now we're going to\Nbe a family together.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.74,0:15:13.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nami and Nojiko have\Nrenewed my love of life.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.74,0:15:23.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The bond between the three of you girls\Ngoes far deeper than any normal family.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.86,0:15:30.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mommy, I thought I'd\Nfind you here. Nojiko?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.76,0:15:34.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, Bellomere's waiting for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.50,0:15:36.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's making us a special supper.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.92,0:15:39.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.00,0:15:41.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think she's making your favorite.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.90,0:15:43.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Omelettes are good to eat, son!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.58,0:15:49.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I love omelettes! Alright!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.94,0:15:56.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The pirates are coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.12,0:15:58.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everybody run!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.66,0:16:02.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The pirates are coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.98,0:16:03.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hide!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.78,0:16:17.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Arlong Pirates! Arlong?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.24,0:16:18.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's impossible!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.52,0:16:21.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why would Fishman from\Nthe Grand Line come here?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.32,0:16:25.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The rumor about the split between\Nthe Fishman and Pirates must be true!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.08,0:16:27.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nami! Nojiko! Genzo!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.24,0:16:30.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's too dangerous for you here.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.30,0:16:31.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go hide in the woods.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.06,0:16:34.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What about... You must go! Now!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.64,0:16:49.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Greetings and salutations,\Nyou pathetic little humans.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.38,0:16:54.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,From this moment on, this entire island and\Nits inhabitants are a part of my domain.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.16,0:16:57.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Listen closely.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.74,0:17:02.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,From now on, on the first day of every\Nmonth, you will buy your lives from me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.86,0:17:08.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,100,000 berries for adults,\N50,000 for children.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.30,0:17:11.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those who cannot pay will die.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.02,0:17:15.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What should we do, Nojiko?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.74,0:17:18.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We don't have that much money.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.04,0:17:21.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe the fishmen won't\Nbe able to find our house.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.70,0:17:23.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't see it from here.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.40,0:17:29.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that it?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.56,0:17:30.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So what's the haul?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.98,0:17:33.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,About 25 million, give or take.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.04,0:17:35.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You all shall live.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.34,0:17:42.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It looks like we each have\Nto pay 100,000 berries
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.38,0:17:45.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To these fishmen every month\Njust to stay alive. No,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.84,0:17:49.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,there's no way we could survive We\Ndon't have a choice We should just be
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.80,0:17:54.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,happy that nobody in the village has been\Nkilled yet If all they want is money,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.28,0:17:55.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that's an easy price to pay
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.28,0:18:02.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just hope they leave without noticing\NBellamere's house With two children,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.20,0:18:04.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,she'd need 200,000 berries
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.74,0:18:07.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no way she has that much saved.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.40,0:18:10.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's time to leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.48,0:18:12.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come, brothers.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.54,0:18:19.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Arlong, there's smoke coming\Nfrom outside the village.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.64,0:18:27.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.55,0:18:28.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's see.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.00,0:18:29.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Delicious.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.91,0:18:33.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There isn't anything quite as tasty\Nas my special tangerine sauce.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.94,0:18:36.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nami and Nojiko are gonna love it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.28,0:18:39.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It looks like chimney smoke\Nfrom somebody's house.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.34,0:18:42.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, we almost missed that one.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.52,0:18:46.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bellamy!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.76,0:18:48.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, let's go, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.36,0:18:52.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.74,0:18:55.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The pirates are going to Bellomir's house!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.46,0:19:00.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Genzo, look!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.52,0:19:01.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nojiko and Nami are gone!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.94,0:19:02.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What did you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.85,0:19:07.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think the duck needs another ten\Nminutes and the stew is almost ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.96,0:19:10.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is definitely\Ngoing to blow my budget,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.14,0:19:12.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but sometimes you've got to live a little.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.00,0:19:24.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bellamy!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.91,0:19:25.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bellamy!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.83,0:19:26.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bellamere's going to be killed!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.72,0:19:36.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We will not abandon Bellamy!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.00,0:19:37.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.10,0:19:39.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why did this happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.38,0:19:40.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hold on, Bellamy!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.56,0:19:46.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, they're here.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.08,0:19:55.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's open!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.60,0:19:56.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come in!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.42,0:19:58.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why, thanks!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.56,0:20:25.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess you weren't\Nexpecting a former marine.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.70,0:20:30.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now what would a pirate from the Grand\NLine want with Cocoyashi Village?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.06,0:20:38.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's so funny?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.44,0:20:48.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Useless, foolish,\Nstupid, empty, worthless.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.58,0:20:53.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All of you humans, you have\Nno strength to speak on.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.26,0:21:03.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll help her escape\Nthrough the back door!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.82,0:21:05.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What if the pirates are already there?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.94,0:21:07.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It'll be okay! Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.68,0:21:12.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Doctor!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.59,0:21:14.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't go back home! What?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.76,0:21:16.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But we have to save Bellamy!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.70,0:21:19.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, Gecko, Nami, quiet and listen to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.56,0:21:20.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There will be times.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.90,0:21:23.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Times in life like this moment now.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.78,0:21:27.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When you have to learn the truth,\Nno matter how hard it is to take.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.18,0:21:42.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's no use.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.60,0:21:46.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,These guys are real monsters,\Nand I'm going to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.14,0:21:47.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, Chico.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.36,0:21:49.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.56,0:21:53.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bellamy, don't waste your life\Nbecause you're a stubborn fool.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.78,0:21:55.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no reason for\Nthis fight when it can
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.78,0:21:58.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,be resolved with a\Nsimple exchange of money.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.72,0:22:02.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just pay the fee, and I'll stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.42,0:22:06.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,$100,000 for each adult and\N$50,000 for each kid, if any.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.86,0:22:11.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you can pay for your whole family,\NI'd gladly spare your lives. Family?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.46,0:22:16.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How much money do you have?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.40,0:22:18.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You need $200,000.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.76,0:22:20.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't have it.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.80,0:22:23.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not even close.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.14,0:22:27.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, the table is set for three in here?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.14,0:22:31.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A family of three.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.16,0:22:35.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's for me and my friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.74,0:22:40.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We were supposed to have\Na nice dinner tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.26,0:22:42.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Before you came.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.88,0:22:43.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come, Bellamy!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.96,0:22:45.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know you've made something wonderful.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.06,0:22:48.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pay them before our food gets cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.48,0:22:50.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just pay the pirates.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.96,0:22:53.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And then they'll leave us alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.76,0:22:55.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now everyone is saved!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.58,0:22:57.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's true!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.52,0:23:01.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The village register shows no record\Nof her marrying or giving birth.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.30,0:23:03.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's always been single.
