Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.26,0:23:09.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Listen!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.17,0:23:12.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no way that the pirates\Nwill ever find out about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.86,0:23:15.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But you have to leave\Nthis island immediately!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.66,0:23:17.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And don't ever look back!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.68,0:23:20.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's the only way for all\Nthree of you to survive!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.74,0:23:23.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can't afford it any other way!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.20,0:23:25.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're much too young to be at sea alone!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.84,0:23:27.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But you've survived before!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.28,0:23:29.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And if there's even a chance! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.58,0:23:32.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't want to!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.24,0:23:35.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want to stay in this village!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.60,0:23:37.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's because!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.90,0:23:38.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're poor!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.02,0:23:41.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's why we can't stay together.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.50,0:23:43.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.48,0:23:45.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why can't they just go away?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.78,0:23:48.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well then.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.40,0:23:51.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now we can all be safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.22,0:23:53.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fine, we'll leave this island.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.82,0:23:56.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have to leave or Pelomir will die.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.38,0:24:15.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, who said I was paying for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.36,0:24:20.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That money I gave up was\Nfor my two daughters.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.48,0:24:22.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I can't pay you!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.28,0:24:26.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you doing? It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.38,0:24:29.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have to do this for my family!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.64,0:24:32.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even if it costs me my life!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.22,0:24:36.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stupid girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.26,0:24:39.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's true the three of us\Naren't related by blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.50,0:24:41.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But we're family.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.32,0:24:44.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All I've ever wanted\Nwas to be their mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.52,0:24:49.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And now, I can be.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.68,0:24:52.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What? No!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.22,0:24:55.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wish that one rich would have adopted us
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.46,0:24:59.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,instead of a stinky loser\Nlike you It was a lie!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.48,0:25:01.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was lying, Bellamy!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.78,0:25:17.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't cry, girls.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.42,0:25:19.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wish I could have...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.46,0:25:21.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I could have provided for you better.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.26,0:25:26.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wish I could have been a\Nbetter mother to the both of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.44,0:25:27.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't say that!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.68,0:25:28.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We don't need anything!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.96,0:25:29.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just don't die!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.00,0:25:30.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't leave us!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.96,0:25:32.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You need to see the map!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.50,0:25:34.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm going to drive the whole world!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.28,0:25:37.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, your map.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.44,0:25:40.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go and make your dreams come true.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.04,0:25:45.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For me.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.68,0:25:47.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tha, I'm here now!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.00,0:25:51.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So these are your daughters?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.78,0:25:55.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.44,0:25:59.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And you have promised me\Nthat you'll leave them alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.68,0:26:03.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No problem, as long as you\Ndie like a good girl. Papa!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.22,0:26:05.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,AAAAAAAH!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.12,0:26:18.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well then, don't kill him, boys.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.88,0:26:21.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, just teach him a lesson.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.40,0:26:23.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now to set an example.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.56,0:26:31.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You ready to die?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.20,0:26:43.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nojiko! Nami!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.04,0:26:47.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Love you.

